window.EN={"1":"...A little over half a year passed after that.","2":"The attack on Leonster by the Friege army under Barath, burning to retake it, was ferocious,","3":"and though Leif's \"Liberation Army\" fought well, they were gradually driven into a corner of the castle.","4":"By now, in anyone's eyes, the fall of Leonster was only a matter of time...","5":"Lord Barath, how goes the battle?","6":"Reinhardt. I've been waiting. You brought reinforcements, I trust.","7":"One corps is on its way here from Ulster. It should arrive shortly.","8":"I see. Then our numbers will be complete.","9":"We have already occupied most of the castle; only this area remains. It will not take much time.","10":"I hope so...","11":"Hm? What do you mean? Is there some problem?","12":"...It has already been half a year since the siege began. And King Bloom is greatly angered that Leonster has still not fallen.","13":"It is not for a youngster such as myself to interject, but I think you would do well to hurry...","14":"...I know.","15":"The King's temper only worsens by the day.","16":"Losing Prince Ishtore at Melgen Castle must have hit him very hard.","17":"How far has the Isaachian army come?","18":"I am told they have already entered the Thracian peninsula.","19":"Cohen's 26th Corps and the mage forces of the three Vampa sisters and Lady Tine are meeting them,","20":"but after all, these are the foes who defeated Lady Liza. A hard fight is unavoidable.","21":"And what is the King himself doing?","22":"It seems he intends to take command at Ulster.","23":"Should the Isaachian army come to threaten Ulster, he will likely call you back, my lord.","24":"If at that time Leonster is still in enemy hands, your own position...","25":"Kh... I know that much!","26":"Then, as I must return to Connacht, I will take my leave...","27":"Hey, someone!!","28":"Sir...","29":"Tell all troops! An all-out attack! Attack, attack, and keep on attacking!","30":"Falling back is not permitted. Smash the enemy with all your strength!","31":"Sir! At once!!","32":"Lord Leif, it has begun. The enemy's all-out attack...","33":"August, can we hold?","34":"Everyone able to move has taken up the defense.","35":"For if this place falls, there is nowhere left to run.","36":"Facing the Empire's great army, I think we've done well to hold out this long.","37":"Half a year under siege already... We may be nearing our limit.","38":"You must not speak so faintheartedly.","39":"That would be betraying those who have fought desperately until now.","40":"It is because we are tying down a large enemy force that Seliph's army can advance with ease.","41":"Until we have joined up with them, we must never give up!","42":"I'm sorry, August. I know...","43":"I want to meet Lord Seliph too. It's only that I can't bear the pity of the soldiers who are dying...","44":"If you feel that way, then all the more.","45":"For the sake of those who fell with their aims half-achieved, too,","46":"we must keep fighting until the last one of us!","47":"Lord Leif, the enemy has begun to withdraw!","48":"What!? What on earth does this mean?","49":"Seliph's army has come!","50":"I am told they are already besieging and attacking Ulster Castle. We are saved!","51":"I see... Lord Seliph...","52":"But August, how did you learn that?","53":"Ah, how careless of me... A messenger came from Lord Seliph a short while ago.","54":"I have him waiting in the inner room.","55":"From Lord Seliph... I want to see him! Show him in at once!","56":"Prince Leif, it is an honor to meet you for the first time.","57":"I serve under Lord Seliph. My name is Diarmuid.","58":"Diarmuid!? Then you are Nanna's brother!?","59":"Yes.","60":"I had been looking forward to meeting Nanna... It is a great pity.","61":"I'm sorry. All because I lacked the strength...","62":"No. It is not your fault, Lord Leif.","63":"I... believe my sister was happy to have been at your side.","64":"Diarmuid...","65":"Lord Leif, this is a letter from Lord Seliph. Please look it over...","66":"I see...","67":"According to this letter, the taking of Ulster won't take much longer...","68":"Yes. Within the next few days...","69":"Then let us head for Ulster too. I want to meet Lord Seliph as soon as possible!","70":"Understood. Then I will guide you.","71":"Diarmuid, that concludes your official business, doesn't it?","72":"Yes...","73":"Then please meet Nanna.","74":"Diarmuid... Brother...","75":"Nanna!? Is it you, Nanna!!","76":"Yes...","77":"Nanna... I'm sorry it has been so long.","78":"If I had known sooner, I would have come for you whatever it took,","79":"but until Lord Lewyn told me, I didn't know about you...","80":"Lord Lewyn...?","81":"Yes. He is Lord Seliph's strategist, and he knows about everything.","82":"He told me about Mother too. That she set out for Isaach to fetch me, but all word of her was lost in the Yied Desert...","83":"!... Then, after all...","84":"I had prepared myself, but so Mother really is... Ahh...","85":"I'm sorry, Nanna. Mother, for my sake...","86":"No... When I was little I resented it, but I understand now.","87":"As a woman myself, how Mother Lachesis felt...","88":"Nanna, I haven't given up.","89":"Lord Lewyn, too, said that Mother is alive.","90":"When this war is over, let's go and look for Mother, the two of us.","91":"So... don't cry anymore.","92":"Prince Leif, I have a request.","93":"Would you let me join your army, Lord Leif?","94":"Of course, I will obtain Lord Seliph's permission.","95":"Yes. For Nanna's sake too, I'd very much like you to.","96":"I'll ask Lord Seliph myself as well.","97":"Prince Leif, the throne has fallen into Friege's hands!","98":"Seeing this, our soldiers are fleeing one after another! Our fight ends here...","99":"Um... is the castle finally in danger?","100":"Please use this staff. We don't really understand it, but it's a magic staff, they say...","101":"Please, don't abandon us! We don't want to go back to those terrifying days!","102":"I won't let the likes of you get in my way!","103":"Guh... So this... is it..."};
